<%# Rendered with 422 when AiGatekeeper raises CrisisError: a crisis term was found in what the guardian wrote, and
    nothing was sent to the AI. The shared partial carries the 988 message; the line below is for a guardian
    worried about a child. %>
<div class="container py-4">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <%= render "shared/ai_error", error_type: :crisis %>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body small">
          <p class="mb-2">
            Nothing you wrote was sent to the AI, and no season was proposed. If a child is in danger right now, call
            911 or your local emergency number.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-0">
            If you are worried a child is being hurt or harmed, the Childhelp National Child Abuse Hotline
            answers around the clock: call or text 1-800-422-4453.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
